<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-C&amp;W Comm rated &quot;hold&quot; at CSFB.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-C&amp;W Comm rated &quot;hold&quot; at CSFB.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cable &amp; Wireless Communications Plc was started as a &quot;hold&quot; at CS First Boston, the investment bank said on Thursday.</p>
<p>In a research note, analyst Evan Miller said his analysis of the stock suggested a &quot;fair value&quot; of between 286p and 308p, giving relatively little upside.</p>
<p>CWC shares were up 1/2p at 261 by 1322 GMT.</p>
<p>-- David Holmesm, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
